WEBVTT

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:34.570
And for Martin, it was incredibly powerful
to see a group of people

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:36.572
that looked like him,

00:09:36.614 --> 00:09:39.908
supporting and fueling the work
of the nonprofit

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:41.285
that was training him.

00:09:42.202 --> 00:09:45.122
So after his training,

00:09:45.122 --> 00:09:50.210
Martin landed this high-profile
internship in Silicon Valley.

00:09:50.586 --> 00:09:53.464
And the very first thing he did

00:09:53.505 --> 00:09:55.966
was give 50 percent,

00:09:55.966 --> 00:09:59.553
half of his signing bonus,
to that nonprofit.